{"version":1,"content":"<html>\n<body><p>\r\n\t\t\t萬聖節周末中環蘭桂坊晚上人流增多，警方實施人流管制措施，港鐵中環站部分出入口因應情況間歇性關閉。<br/>\n<br/>\r\n蘭桂坊協會稱，今年萬聖節相關活動氣氛很好，商戶營業額均有增長。<br/>\n<br/>\r\n政府預料深宵時段跨境人流及車流會增多，部分公共交通已加密往來口岸路線班次。<br/>\n<br/>\n<br/>\n<br/>\n<br/>\r\n編輯：梁家奇\t\t</p>\n</body>\n</html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-01T03:38:11.300735+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":125,"images":0,"source":"RTHK 本地","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-10-31T11:49:40+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-01T03:31:26.881065+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-01T03:31:26.881065+00:00","content_hash":"fe7718e8a987f760f95dda6bfd26bc6706e384f726315c0a72d8c8d48b3f8005","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}